  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>属性值加成</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>体型</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>速度</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>选择一项：<br>(a)选择一项属性+2;选择一项不同的属性+1 (b)选择三项不同的属性+1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">小型/中等</span></p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">30尺</span>；<span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">与你步行速度相同的攀爬速度。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">生物类型 Creature Type。</strong> 你是类人生物。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">体型 Size。</strong> 你的体型为中型或小型。选择此种族的时候决定你的体型。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">速度 Speed。</strong> 你的步行速度为 30 尺，你拥有与你步行速度相同的攀爬速度。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">巧足 Dexterous Feet。</strong> 以一个附赠动作，你能用你的脚操纵一个物件、打开或关上一扇门或容器、或是捡起或放下一个微型物件。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">滑翔 Glide。</strong>当你从至少离地10尺的高度坠落时，你可以用你的反应展开你的翼膜，水平滑行一段等同于你步行速度的距离（其方向由你决定），本次摔落对你造成的伤害变为0。</span></p><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hadozee Dodge\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">鼯猴坚毅</strong></span><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Hadozee Dodge。</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">你血管中流淌的魔法增强了你的天生防御力。当你受到伤害时，你可以用反应投掷一枚d6。你受到的伤害减少 投掷结果+你的熟练加值 点（最低降至0） 。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">你能使用此特质次数等同于你的熟练加值，完成一次长休后，你重获全部已消耗的使用次数。</span></p></div></div></div></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">语言 Languages</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">你的角色能够说、读和写通用语和另一种你和 DM 认为适合该角色的语言。《玩家手册》提供了一项可供选择的泛用语言列表。DM 能自由地为特定战役从列表中去掉或增加语言。</span></p></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">第一批鼯猴人是怯弱的哺乳动物，比家猫大不了多少。为了躲避体型更大的自然捕食者的猎杀，鼯猴人开始在树上活动，并进化出像翅膀一样的翼膜，使它们能够在树枝间滑翔。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><s style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal\">几百年前，一位法师带着一支小型魔法船舰队访问了鼯猴人的家乡世界--亚齐尔（Yazir）。在法师的指导下，学徒们布置了魔法陷阱，捕获了几十个鼯猴人。法师给被捕获的鼯猴人们喂了一种实验性的灵药，使他们身体变大，并成为有智慧的双足生物。这种药水具有副作用，它还增强了鼯猴人们对恐惧的抵抗，因此他们在受到伤害时会更加坚韧。法师原本的计划是创造出一支由增强后的鼯猴人战士所组成的军队，并销售给最高的出价者。然而事与愿违，法师的学徒们对鼯猴人们产生了越来越多的情感，并最终帮助他们逃脱。学徒和鼯猴人们不得不杀了法师，之后便带上法师剩余的实验灵药逃走。<br>在解放者的帮助下，鼯猴人回到了他们的家乡世界，并用灵药创造了更多的同类。随着时间的推移，所有的鼯猴人新生儿都拥有了强化鼯猴人的特征。然后，在几个世纪前，鼯猴人登上了星空，将亚齐尔可怕的掠食者抛在了身后。</s><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">（注：该段背景文本已被Errata删除）<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">如今，鼯猴人是有着智慧直立行走生物，他们渴望着躲避那些捕食者，探索其他的世界。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">除了是天生的攀爬好手外，鼯猴人的脚和他们的手一样灵巧，甚至有能跟其他趾头相对的脚拇指。他们的胳膊和腿上松散地挂着翼膜。当被绷紧时，这些翼膜使鼯猴人能够滑行。鼯猴人将这些翅膀包裹在自己身上以保持温暖。</span></p></div><div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Choose one of: (a) Choose any +2; choose any other +1 (b) Choose three different +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Small/Medium</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft., climb equal to your walking speed</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Size.</span> You are Medium or Small. You choose the size when you select this race.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Dexterous Feet\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Dexterous Feet.</span> As a bonus action, you can use your feet to manipulate an object, open or close a door or container, or pick up or set down a Tiny object.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Glide\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Glide.</span> When you fall at least 10 feet above the ground, you can use your reaction to extend your skin membranes to glide horizontally a number of feet equal to your walking speed, and you take 0 damage from the fall. You determine the direction of the glide.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hadozee Dodge\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Hadozee Dodge.</span> The magic that runs in your veins heightens your natural defenses. When you take damage, you can use your reaction to roll a [[/r d6]]. Add your proficiency bonus to the number rolled, and reduce the damage you take by an amount equal to that total (minimum of 0 damage).</p><p>You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus. You regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and one other language that you and your DM agree is appropriate for your character.</p></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\"><p>Hadozees' progenitors were mammals no bigger than housecats. Hunted by larger natural predators, they took to the trees and evolved wing-like flaps that enabled them to glide from branch to branch.</p><p>Today, hadozees are sapient, bipedal beings eager to leave behind the fearsome predators of their homeworld and explore other worlds.</p><p>In addition to being natural climbers, hadozees have feet that are as dexterous as their hands, even to the extent of having opposable thumbs. Membranes of skin hang loosely from their arms and legs. When stretched taut, these membranes enable hadozees to glide. Hadozees wrap these wings around themselves to keep warm.</p></div>",
